freezer I did not buy at all.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.780
People talk about how great
Zoey Deutch was in the role.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.510
I guess she is, but she's great
at playing a shit character.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:19.670
I just could not--
- Wow.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:20.710
- Yeah, I just could not stand

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.520
her character at all.
- My goodness.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.350
(laughing)

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.630
Same with that dude introduced

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.160
for Abigail Breslin's character, that...

00:07:31.209 --> 00:07:34.360
- Berkeley.
- Berkeley, the hippie dude.

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:35.390
I was confused as to

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.620
how any of these characters
survived 10 years,

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.340
15 years into a zombie apocalypse.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.570
- [Scott] We're talking
about a zombie movie,

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:42.680
a zombie comedy.

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:45.460
- But what's great about "Zombieland" one

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:49.460
