and very rules-focused--

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:50.293
- [Scott] And he still lived.

00:07:50.293 --> 00:07:52.660
- Right, but you buy that he can survive

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.030
in this sort of apocalypse.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:58.170
Same with Tallahassee, same
