00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.390
they work really well,

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.690
whereas these two other characters,

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.250
it's hard for me to buy
them in our own reality.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.590
