00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.740
because if I'm watching
"Walking Dead", Chauncey,

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.000
and then somebody's been living

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.340
in a pink, hairy freezer for 10 years,

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:15.390
it seems like a stretch,

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.520
but for the tone of "Zombieland"

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:18.860
I thought particularly Zoey's character

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:20.050
stole a lot of scenes.

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:22.390
I thought Madison was there.
- Yeah, I love Madison.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:23.258
I thought she was hilarious,

00:08:23.258 --> 00:08:25.180
not just because of the
way she played the part

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:28.690
