00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.110
She's a big genre fan anyway,

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.350
but you can tell that she
was having a lot of fun.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.700
Great chemistry especially
with Woody Harrelson.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.510
I really thought that in terms

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.800
